 "traps": [
  "most services are the notification integrations in hc/integrations/<name>/transport.py; their folder names (pd, po, msteamsw, call, sms) are not the service names (PagerDuty, Pushover, Microsoft Teams, Twilio)",
  "call, sms and whatsapp all go through the Twilio API: one service",
  "the database is SQLite unless DB is postgres or mysql (mariadb is an accepted alias of mysql); the compose file starts PostgreSQL only",
  "apprise, minio and Markdown are in requirements-dev.txt although apprise and S3 offloading are runtime features",
  "the SMTP listener (minismtpd, SMTPD_PORT) is the project's own inbound server, not an external service; outbound mail uses EMAIL_HOST",
  "Bootstrap 3.4.1 and jQuery are vendored under static/; tests use Django's test runner, there is no pytest",
  "the requirements files name no project, so the unit is referred to by its root",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
